  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/746/32/simply_light_sources_title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1002\" height=\"241\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">簡易光源為玩家提供128種不同燈具進行裝飾</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\">多數燈具可多方向放置，激發更多創意可能</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">(v1.3.0版本共201種光源)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">(v1.2.0版本共128種光源)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">(v1.1.0版本共73種光源)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">(v1.0.0版本共42種光源)</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1092/945/light-storage-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">彩色燈具：</h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">16種顏色變化</h5><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/848/853/colored-lamps.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">RGB LED燈：</h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">根據紅石訊號強度變換顏色</h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">訊號強度0為白色</h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">訊號強度15為粉色</h5><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/746/26/sls.png\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">紅石能源控制器：</h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">在控制器表面放置羊毛可調整紅石能量強度</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/980/829/2024-09-20_01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">更多燈具類型：</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/980/826/2024-09-20_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></p><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/848/957/sls9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/980/828/2024-09-20_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/980/827/2024-09-20_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/848/959/the-beach.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">未來可能持續新增</h5><p>&nbsp;</p>",
